    "label": "SITL 32 Param echo timeout",
    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Prove AP-1 is reachable with LOIT_SPEED_MS, then set unknown WPNAV_SPEED — confirm must surface echo timeout, not a fake success from a dead peer.",
