  },
  {
    "id": "sitl32-comment",
    "type": "comment",
    "z": "sitl32-tab",
    "name": "Known confirm then unknown id → echo timeout",
    "info": "1. Set LOIT_SPEED_MS=10 REAL32 with echo-confirm — proves AP-1 answers PARAM_VALUE.\n2. Set WPNAV_SPEED (absent on Copter 4.7.0 §14) with confirm — must finish as timed-out / echo timeout.\nA dead peer would also timeout; the known-param step is what makes the negative path meaningful.\n\nConnection: AP bind 0.0.0.0:14550 → 127.0.0.1:14551 sysid 1.",
    "x": 300,
    "y": 40,
    "wires": []
  },
